                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.48/1571: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-08-22T15:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">August 22,
                                1921—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>492. First party of American Relief Administration personnel leave Riga for
                    Moscow Thursday. May they retain their American passports?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Young</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
